{"summary":"Defend a dying world. Pixel-art tap battles, choices, multiple endings.","description":"■ Story\nIn the not-so-distant future, a world on the brink of ruin.\nAwakening in the wasteland is a single robot—with no limbs and no memories.\nYou become the settlement's \"gatekeeper,\" fending off the strange visitors who arrive day after day.\n\nCan you protect the settlement through its final days?\nAnd what is the true nature of the Flat Machine...?\n\n■ Features\n[1] Easy, satisfying defense battles—just tap!\nTap with the right timing to repel the enemies closing in.\nSimple to play, yet endlessly strategic through gear and item combinations. Build your own ultimate defense style.\n\n[2] Your \"choices\" change the future—multiple endings\nNot everyone at the gate is an enemy.\nHelp a struggling mutant, or coldly turn it away?\nYour decisions steer the story to its ending in this rich sci-fi adventure.\n\n[3] Charming pixel art and a wistful apocalyptic world\nLovable yet lonely characters brought to life in beautiful retro pixel art.\nAn original atmosphere, deepened by a carefully crafted soundtrack.\n\n■ Perfect for players who love\n- Pixel-art (retro) games\n- Dystopian, sci-fi, and apocalyptic worlds\n- Story-driven indie games\n- Quick, pick-up-and-play sessions\n- Tower defense, idle games, and RPGs\n- Playing free to the end, at your own pace, with no stamina\n\nStep into the \"everyday apocalypse\" woven by an amnesiac gatekeeper robot and the inhabitants of a dying world.","esrbNotes":"Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":"Mild Violence","iapPrices":"$0.99 - $37.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xdit5RsJqrc?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0FhtvmCkn6rJFkOxC7wTUz9OTMxicKALSu3eCbuCaySlgYA38gUmsoljp-Rq_cvvCbTpuf79D2330WnFuaq-Rg","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WVOb6nfSmPq6rf8Fzt5etnxi3EK4YEIjcU6GHMdtjRLnl099y_dlPCLwxMdEU7T47SOmA_fz40a3yZyt1Xqg","https://play-lh.goo